      "extract": "In this paper we bigrade the Hopf algebra of undecorated rooted trees, and both of its closed Hopf subalgebras, taking account of Hochschild cohomology. In [@DK]--[@shuffle] we have exposed the connection between renormalization and Hopf algebra. The joblist of renormalization specifies a noncocommutative coproduct, $\\Delta$. On the left are products of divergent subdiagrams; on the right these shrink to points. An",
